    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Application Insights \u2014 live telemetry (Log Analytics, ~1\u20132 min freshness)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 30 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requests vs failures (per minute)",
      "description": "Live request volume and failed requests straight from Application Insights telemetry.",
      "datasource": { "type": "grafana-azure-monitor-datasource", "uid": "__DS_UID__" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 31 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 15, "lineWidth": 2 }, "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [ { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Failed" }, "properties": [ { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } } ] } ] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "Azure Log Analytics",
          "datasource": { "type": "grafana-azure-monitor-datasource", "uid": "__DS_UID__" },
          "azureLogAnalytics": {
            "resources": [ "__LAW_ID__" ],
            "resultFormat": "time_series",
            "query": "AppRequests | where $__timeFilter(TimeGenerated) | summarize Requests=count(), Failed=countif(Success == false) by bin(TimeGenerated, 1m) | order by TimeGenerated asc"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request duration percentiles (p50 / p95 / p99)",
      "description": "Server-side latency distribution from Application Insights. p95/p99 spikes reveal the latency-injection challenges.",
      "datasource": { "type": "grafana-azure-monitor-datasource", "uid": "__DS_UID__" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 31 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 2 }, "unit": "ms" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "Azure Log Analytics",
          "datasource": { "type": "grafana-azure-monitor-datasource", "uid": "__DS_UID__" },
          "azureLogAnalytics": {
            "resources": [ "__LAW_ID__" ],
            "resultFormat": "time_series",
            "query": "AppRequests | where $__timeFilter(TimeGenerated) | summarize p50=percentile(DurationMs,50), p95=percentile(DurationMs,95), p99=percentile(DurationMs,99) by bin(TimeGenerated, 1m) | order by TimeGenerated asc"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Exceptions per minute",
      "description": "Application exceptions from Application Insights. Lights up during the error / crash challenges.",
      "datasource": { "type": "grafana-azure-monitor-datasource", "uid": "__DS_UID__" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 39 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "drawStyle": "bars", "fillOpacity": 60, "lineWidth": 1 }, "unit": "short", "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "single" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "Azure Log Analytics",
          "datasource": { "type": "grafana-azure-monitor-datasource", "uid": "__DS_UID__" },
          "azureLogAnalytics": {
            "resources": [ "__LAW_ID__" ],
            "resultFormat": "time_series",
            "query": "AppExceptions | where $__timeFilter(TimeGenerated) | summarize Exceptions=count() by bin(TimeGenerated, 1m) | order by TimeGenerated asc"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Top failing operations (last selected window)",
      "description": "Which endpoints are failing right now \u2014 the fastest way to point learners at the broken service.",
      "datasource": { "type": "grafana-azure-monitor-datasource", "uid": "__DS_UID__" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 39 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "align": "auto" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "showHeader": true },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "Azure Log Analytics",
          "datasource": { "type": "grafana-azure-monitor-datasource", "uid": "__DS_UID__" },
          "azureLogAnalytics": {
            "resources": [ "__LAW_ID__" ],
            "resultFormat": "table",
            "query": "AppRequests | where $__timeFilter(TimeGenerated) | summarize Total=count(), Failed=countif(Success == false) by OperationName | where Failed > 0 | order by Failed desc | take 10"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Need the per-second live stream?",
      "description": "Log Analytics panels above refresh every ~1\u20132 min. For the true sub-second stream, open Application Insights Live Metrics.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 47 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### \ud83d\udd34 Live Metrics (sub-second stream)\nThe panels above are near-real-time (~1\u20132 min). For the instant-by-instant view as you inject a fault, open **[Application Insights \u2192 Live Metrics](https://portal.azure.com/#@__TENANT__/resource/subscriptions/__SUB_ID__/resourceGroups/__RG__/providers/Microsoft.Insights/components/__APPI__/quickPulse)** in the Azure portal."
      }
    }
